@startuml
title Session start with contextual blocking setup
actor Learner
participant "Timer UI" as Timer
participant "Local rules + protection APIs" as API
participant "Setup dialog" as Dialog
participant Settings
Learner -> Timer : Start session
Timer -> Timer : validate project and timer inputs\nretain draft; prevent duplicate start
Timer -> API : read enabled Block rules and relevant readiness
API --> Timer : ready / missing setup / unavailable
alt ready or no enabled Block rules
  Timer -> API : start session once
else missing setup or check unavailable
  Timer -> Dialog : explain relevant app / website gap
  alt Set up blocking
    Dialog -> Settings : open compact blocking controls\nretain timer draft
    Learner -> Settings : configure with explicit consent dialogs
    Settings -> Timer : return to saved draft; no auto-start
  else Start without blocking
    Dialog -> API : start session once\nleave consent and rules unchanged
  else Cancel / Escape
    Dialog -> Timer : restore focus; do not start
  end
end
@enduml
